This plugin is a modified fork (改造版) of muyikk/astrbot_plugin_hextechmayhem,
which in turn was inspired by the user-facing features of
PayneXie/astrbot_plugin_hextech.

Upstream base implementation (GPL-3.0 only):
  https://github.com/muyikk/astrbot_plugin_hextechmayhem
  Copyright (C) 2026 muyikk

Feature inspiration:
  https://github.com/PayneXie/astrbot_plugin_hextech

Modifications in this fork (Copyright (C) 2026 the fork authors) add:
  - /海斗胜率        two-sided win-rate ranking (TOP / BOTTOM)
  - augment win-rate and pick-rate display in /海克斯 and /海斗 searches
  - smart hero-or-augment resolution for /海斗
  - relaxed Pillow constraint so the plugin can coexist with AstrBot's
    core dependency version locking

